abstract: >
  Benchmark comparing four open-source mesh simplification methods
  (fast-simplification, Open3D, meshoptimizer, CGAL) for independent game
  developers. Evaluates geometric accuracy, processing performance, and
  perceptual quality on production game assets and Stanford 3D Scanning
  Repository models. Includes a pairwise-comparison perceptual study
  (~150 participants, ~2800 judgments). Provides scenario-based tool
  selection guidance for resource-constrained developers.
